# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ReplyAI — Production env vars (committed for Vercel fallback)
#
# These values are loaded by Next.js automatically at build/runtime
# on Vercel when NEXT_PUBLIC_* / DATABASE_* / NEXTAUTH_* are NOT set
# in the Vercel dashboard. If they ARE set in the dashboard, the
# dashboard values override these.
#
# Demo-only deployment. Demo credentials (demo@replyai.app / demo1234)
# are already public in the UI, so committing these values does not
# introduce new risk. Replace with a fresh NEXTAUTH_SECRET and a fresh
# Turso DB token before going to production.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Database (Turso / libSQL) ─────────────────────────────────
